<title>SINGAPORE: Labroy sees 10 million shares crossed.</title>
<headline>Labroy sees 10 million shares crossed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipping company Labroy Marine saw 10 million shares crossed at Singapore $2.00 on Monday morning, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0323 GMT, Labroy wa up Singapore $0.03 to S$2.04 on 10.6 million shares, including the crossed trade.</p>
<p>&quot;Some institutions have been favouring the stock since it was much lower in price. They could have been buying in anticipation of some deals,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>Another trader said syndicates had pushed up its share price over the last few months.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
